<title>USA: Ryder buys stake in Brazilian logistics firm.</title>
<headline>Ryder buys stake in Brazilian logistics firm.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryder System Inc said its Ryder do Brasil Ltda unit has purchased a minority stake in Companhia Transportadora e Comercial Translor SA, a leading Brazilian provider of integrated automotive logistics.</p>
<p>Ryder said the venture will provide integrated logistics solutions to automotive industry customers in the Brazilian and Mercosul markets.</p>
</text>
